// Title: WmiPrvSE Spawned A Process
// Rule ID: d21374ff-f574-44a7-9998-4a8c8bf33d7d
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_wmiprvse_spawning_process.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
